        why: 'AI only gets as good as the input it reads.',
        pages: [L.readiness, L.pinkTest, L.tokenNaming, L.cheatSheet],
        done: "The readiness checklist is filled in for one master of the Atelier file, the Figma linter's findings on that master are sorted, and on a copy of a master in the prepared duplicate on your machine one fill is bound to a Library Tokens variable, one variant value is added and one frame uses Auto Layout. The checklist for your own file is a handout.",
        bullets: [
          'Tour before lunch (11:25–12:00, 35 min: 5 opener, 15 tokens, 15 structure). How designers think — open the Atelier file',
